    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n2 Temple Hall is a wonderfully presented one-bedroom apartment ideally situated within this mature and well-maintained development in the heart of Dublin City Centre. Benefiting from an exceptionally convenient location, a host of shops, cafés, restaurants, and transport links are all within easy reach.\n\nThe bright and well-proportioned accommodation briefly comprises of a entrance hall with storage room, a generous open-plan living and dining room, a separate kitchen, a spacious double bedroom, and a main bathroom with additional storage room.\n\nLocated on Parnell Street, Apartment 2 Temple Hall offers the very best of city living, with numerous Dublin Bus routes and both the Red and Green Luas lines just a short stroll away. The Jervis Shopping Centre, Henry Street, O'Connell Street, and Grafton Street are all within walking distance, making this an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, and those seeking a convenient city-centre home. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.278m x 3.137m\nWarm and welcoming entrance hall with laminate wood flooring and access to generous storage room.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 2.924m x 4.898m\nOpen plan living/dining room with laminate wood flooring, large picture frame window flooding the room with natural light benefitting from the room's south orientation.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.969m x 3.777m\nGenerously proportioned double bedroom, with laminate wood flooring, large south facing picture frame window and built in wardrobe.\n\nKitchen - 2.421m x 1.682m\nWell appointed kitchen positioned to the rear of the living/dining room, featuring tiled flooring and splashback, oven, four ring hob, washer dryer, fridge, and ample storage in the floor and wall mounted cupboards.\n\nBathroom - 1.694m x 1.965m\nBathroom with tiled flooring, wc, whb, mall mounted mirror, bath & shower attachment, as well as an additional storage room.\n\nStorage - 0.791m x 0.660m\nStorage located in the bathroom.\n\nStorage Room - 0.593m x 1.691m\nStorage room access via the entrance hall.\n\n"
      },
